I implemented line clearing in the Tetris game. When a horizontal line is completely filled with blocks, it is removed and all lines above it shift down by one row.

The next recommended increment is to implement a scoring system that awards points based on the number of lines cleared simultaneously (single, double, triple, tetris). This would involve adding a score variable, updating it when lines are cleared, and displaying the score on the screen.
